rcdir}/llama.cpp\" -B \"${srcdir}/build\" -G Ninja \\\n```\n*   **`-S \"${srcdir}/llama.cpp\"`**: Specifies the **source directory**. This is where the `llama.cpp` source code resides (downloaded via the `source` array in the PKGBUILD).\n*   **`-B \"${srcdir}/build\"`**: Specifies the **build directory**. CMake will generate all intermediate files (Make"}